Welcome to Orderlane! 🚀

<%= @organization.name %> is now all set up and ready to start managing your distribution business.

Here's what you can do next:

1. Add your first customer (retailer)
   - Go to Customers and click "Add Customer"
   - Enter customer details

2. Set up your product catalog
   - Go to Products and click "Add Product"
   - Define your SKUs with pricing and tax info

3. Create your first order
   - Go to Orders and click "Create Order"
   - Select customer and add products

4. Manage payments and tracking
   - Track customer payments
   - Monitor order delivery status

You're just 3 steps away from your first successful order! 💪

